      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kyle&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Kyle</EnglishText>
      <Status>To Do</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ルーティ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Rutee</EnglishText>
      <Status>To Do</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Loni&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Loni</EnglishText>
      <Status>To Do</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Speakers>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <JapaneseText>デュナミス孤児院・&lt;Kyle&gt;の部屋</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Dunamis Orphanage - &lt;Kyle&gt;'s Room</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <JapaneseText>デュナミス孤児院</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Dunamis Orphanage</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kyle&gt;の部屋</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Kyle&gt;'s Room</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <JapaneseText>さあ、どうしようかな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well then, what am I gonna do?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <JapaneseText>　もう寝る　
　まだ眠くない　</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText> Go to bed 
 I'm still not sleepy </EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <JapaneseText>三百万ガルドのレンズ････か
そんなの持って帰ってきたら
みんな、ビックリするだろうなぁ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A 3,000,000 Gald Lens...huh.
I betcha everyone would be
surprised if I came back with that thing.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <JapaneseText>母さんは、ああ言ってたけど
オレだって、いつか必ず
父さんのような英雄になってみせる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mom may have said those things about me,
but I'm definitely going to prove her wrong
someday and become a hero just like dad.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <JapaneseText>そのためにも
明日は････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And in order to do that,
tomorrow, I need to...</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;size:00000180&gt;うわあぁぁぁっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;size:00000180&gt;Uwaaaahh!</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <JapaneseText>キャアッ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wah!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <JapaneseText>････あれ？
母さん････？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Huh?
Mom...?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <JapaneseText>もう、ビックリしたじゃない！
いきなり大声だすんだもの！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Geez, don't scare me like that!
You let out a big scream all of a sudden!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <JapaneseText>まあいいわ
起こす手間がはぶけたし</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh well, no matter. It saved me the trouble
of having to wake you up and everything.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <JapaneseText>しっかし、めずらしいわね
あんたがスカッと起きるなんて
今日は、雪でもふる････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But I must say, it certainly is unusual
for you to be wide awake first thing in
the morning. It might even snow today...</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <JapaneseText>････はぁ
結局、いつもと同じか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...*sigh*. So things turned out
the same way in the end, huh?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <JapaneseText>いくわよ････
秘技、死者の目覚め!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Here I go...Master Arte,
Wake The Dead!!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <JapaneseText>うわぁっ！
な、な、なんだぁ!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Aaahh!
W, w, what the!?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ほらほら、起きた起きた！
朝ごはんが片づかないでしょ!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Come on now, rise and shine!
You DO want to have some breakfast, don't you!?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <JapaneseText>あっと、&lt;Loni&gt;はもう起きてるわよ
あんたが起きるのを待ってる････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, I almost forgot to tell
you that Loni's already awake.
He's waiting for you to get up...</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;size:00000180&gt;&lt;Kyle&gt;！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;size:00000180&gt;&lt;Kyle&gt;!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <JapaneseText>はっ、はいぃ！
起きてます、起きてます！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Y, yes ma'am!
I'm awake, I'm awake!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ルーティ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Rutee</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <JapaneseText>････よろしい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Very well then.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ふわあぁぁ････
なんだったんだろ、あの夢････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>*yawns*...
What was the deal with that dream...</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <JapaneseText>････ふわぁ････むにゃむにゃ････
････とりあえず
&lt;Loni&gt;のところに行かなきゃ････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...*yawns*...Nnn...
...for now, I hafta go to where &lt;Loni&gt; is...</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kyle&gt;は
称号「&lt;item:00000817&gt;」を得ました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Kyle&gt; acquired the title
&quot;&lt;item:00000817&gt;&quot;.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <JapaneseText>････結局、ゆうべは
眠れなかったな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...After all, last night
I couldn't sleep.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <JapaneseText>とにかく、もう一度
母さんに話すんだ
旅に出るって！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Anyway, again.
I'm going to tell Mom.
We're going on a trip!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kyle&gt;！
おい&lt;Kyle&gt;、起きろ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Kyle&gt;!
Hey &lt;Kyle&gt;, wake up!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <JapaneseText>むにゃ････
････おはよ、&lt;Loni&gt;････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Munyaa...
Good morning, &lt;Loni&gt;...</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <JapaneseText>寝ぼけてる場合じゃねえぞ！
ついに、出やがったんだ！
「神のたまご」が！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This is no time to be sleepwalking!
It's finally here! The egg of the gods!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <JapaneseText>････出る････？
たまご････？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...out...?
Eggs...?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <JapaneseText>「神のたまご」が････!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>God's Egg is now available at...?!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <JapaneseText>いいから、早く来い！
みんな待ってんぞ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Just come on, come on!
They're waiting for you!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <JapaneseText>　休む　
　休まない　</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText> Rest 
 Don't rest </EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <JapaneseText>オレもたまには
勉強しなくちゃな････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I have to study once
in a while too. </EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <JapaneseText>棚には&lt;Kyle&gt;のオモチャしか
入っていない････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The shelves only contain &lt;Kyle&gt;'s toys.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <JapaneseText>窓の外には牧歌的な風景が広がっている</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Idyllic scenery outside the window.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <JapaneseText>いってらっしゃいませ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Have a good day.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;0B:00000001&gt;{14}{34}{08}{C0}&lt;0B:00000000&gt;ガルドになりますが
お泊まりになりますか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It'll be &lt;0B:00000001&gt;{14}{34}{08}{C0}&lt;0B:00000000&gt; gald a night.
Would you like to stay?</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <JapaneseText>お泊まりになりますか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Would you like to stay?</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;03:00000000&gt;　はい　
　いいえ　</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;03:00000000&gt; Yes 
 No </EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ごゆっくりお休みください</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Have a good night.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <JapaneseText>おはようございます</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Good morning.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>45</Id>
      <JapaneseText>お金が足りません</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Not enough money.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <JapaneseText>またのおこしをお待ちしております</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>See you again soon.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>47</Id>
      <JapaneseText>{16}{25}{E2}{C0}を手に入れました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Acquired {16}{25}{E2}{C0}.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>48</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;item:FFFFFFFF&gt;を手に入れました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Acquired &lt;item:FFFFFFFF&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>49</Id>
      <JapaneseText>{16}{25}{EA}{C0}がありましたが
いっぱいで持てませんでした</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText/>
      <Status>To Do</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>50</Id>
      <JapaneseText>何もありません</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There's nothing here.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
